                                        {
                                            "assessment_type": "Observation/Task",
                                            "description": "Observe the learners in their groups as they discuss the tasks below. During the process of the presentation, are learners communicating effectively? Are they learning from one another? Are they creative and critical?\n1. Alupo thinks of a number. She carries out two calculations on the number. First, she adds 5. Then she multiplies the sum by 3. Her result is 27. What was Alupo’s original number?\n2. Sketch the region enclosed by the inequalities y≤4-x² and y>2x-4."
                                        }
